"Support for several obsolete browsers has been removed. Removed browsers "
"include Grail, Mosaic, Netscape, Galeon, Skipstone, Iceape, and Firefox "
"versions 35 and below."
msgstr ""
"Die Unterstützung für mehrere veraltete Browser wurde entfernt. Dazu gehören "
"Grail, Mosaic, Netscape, Galeon, Skipstone, Iceape und Firefox in den "
"Versionen 35 und darunter."

